***conformance tests***

# t4-silence
T4: two days without a check-in gives RED for MEDIUM; one missed day gives RED for HIGH.

# t5-reason-rule-id
T5: every Assessment has at least one reason with a ruleId.

# t14-risk-tier
T14: the risk tier sets check-in frequency, duration and silence escalation speed.
